  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a55a317bdeeb0d458678f5057e3fb94, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96ada71f390d76d4da6c300fbea2b6de, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdd0f3e893fdded45b51221fffafc746, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d90a362486708fe458e0939ea5d4cba2, type: 3}
  mouthShouldMove: 000100010001000101000101000100010001
  subtitles:
  - 
  - "[Tariq] So we\u2019ve been on this mission for over an hour, and you haven\u2019t
    said a word."
  - '[Lance] Silence helps me think.'
  - '[Tariq] Funny. Most people use words for that.'
  - "[Lance] Most people aren\u2019t driving across the desert to fix broken promises. "
  - "[Tariq] \u2026Fair point."
  - "[Lance] You sure the turbine\u2019s still fixable?"
  - "[Tariq] If it isn\u2019t, the village stays dark."
  - "[Tariq] Anyways. What\u2019s your name?"
  - '[Lance] Lance. Lance Ford.'
  - "[Tariq] I\u2019m Tariq, I\u2019m a local."
  - "[Tariq] What about you? Where\u2019d you come from?"
  - '[Lance] Halfway across the world, Canada.'
  - "[Tariq] Canada, huh\u2026 land of snow and endless electricity."
  - '[Lance] Not everywhere.'
  - "[Tariq] Soo what\u2019s your story? What brings someone like you all the way
    out here?"
  - "[Lance] It\u2019s... personal."
  - "[Tariq] Well, we don\u2019t have anything better to do right now do we?"
  - 
